ilities including the so called the  mark of the Sun state this state allows  Tantra to become even stronger and  faster and he is able to effectively  fight against upper moon demons in this  state although we have to mention that  while being in this state drastically  increases tangelos abilities he is only  rarely able to enter this state and he  is only able to use it for a small  amount of time before it takes a  tremendous toll on his body on top of  that tangelo is able to unlock even  higher potential when he combines his  abilities with the abilities of his  sister nez Zuko as we eventually find  out  Naza ko is able to use her blood to set  kanjuro sword on fire and turn it from  black to red when it becomes red tundra  sword looks like the red sword used by  the legendary breath of the Sun user who  lived many centuries ago as I mentioned  earlier there are multiple blatant clues  that tan Jo's family is directly  connected to the breath of the Sun user  including the hanafuda  earrings with the Sun symbol which were  said to have been worn by the breath of  the Sun user the dance of the fire-god  and marks entendre rose face which are  set to appear on warriors who use the  wrath of the Sun and so on it is worth  noting that in chapters 57 and 58 of the  manga we learned that tan Jiro has an  unusually warm bright and powerful  spiritual core which may become  important again at some point in the  future with such an above-average  spiritual core it is fair to assume that  tan 0 has above-average potential to  keep getting spiritually stronger more  so than an average person and even  though it may appear as if tan 0 is just  lucky because he was born with a family  connection to the breadth of the Sun he  has an unusually sensitive sense of  smell an unusually powerful spiritual  core and so on it must be emphasized  that even though he is a shown and  protagonist tanjo is not overpowered to  the point of being a broken character in  demon slayer powerful antagonists like  the upper demon moons are never defeated  by just pan Jiro and his lower ranked  friends alone because of how strong  their friendship is or because of how  badly they really want to win whenever a  major antagonist like an upper moon is  defeated in the series it is always due  to a lot of teamwork and it always  involves at least one hashira or pillar  sometimes it involves a whole group of  hashira fighting against the villain at  the same time along with some lower rank  demon Slayers like town zeros and itsu  and so on teamwork is extremely  important in demon slayer just getting  really angry at your opponent is not  going to secure your victory in this  series furthermore tandro is not the  only character with a direct connection  to the breadth of the Sun user for  example Mui cheeto the mist hashira also  has a direct blood connection to the  breath of the Sun user  so while tan Jiro was definitely born  with certain privileges pertaining to  his family lineage he is not entirely  unique in this regard after chapter 151  tan Jiro is able to unlock another  important battle technique he learns to  access the see-through world a world in  which all movements seemed slower and  within which tandro is able to see the  inside of his opponent's bodies and all  of his opponent's movements including  the movement of the opponent's lungs and  inner organs and this allows him to  predict an opponent's moves in battle  more accurately Tangiers dad was also  able to use this technique and upper  demon moon one Kaku Shiva can use it as  well  furthermore all humans have a battle  spirit that can be sensed by others but  in chapters 1 5 2 &amp; 1 5 3 Tangier learns  to make his battle spirit and murderous  intent / hatred disappear completely  which prevents those who can sense  battle spirit and murderous intent from  sensing tangi Rose moves in battle so we  know that tan Jiro clearly has a lot of  special powers and abilities and at  least by the